            "value" : "This page sets its own StackLayout(spacing: 4) via list.layout — the standard way clients configure layouts; the interactive demo (selection modes, add/remove items, UniformGridLayout switch) lives in the Item List View page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
